      "writtenOn": "2024-01-09T22:02:08Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "While the full api surface libraries for public, system, test, module lib and system server api surfaces follow the naming scheme `android_\u003cAPI_SURFACE\u003e_stubs_current` (i.e. the separator is `_`), the full api surface library for the core api surface is named `core.current.stubs` (i.e. the separator is `.`), and this is the reason for the differentiation.",
      "parentUuid": "7b7fa9dd_53ec7b28",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 114,
